<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HomeSide raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HomeSide raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Painewebber has raised its rating on HomeSide Inc to buy from attractive, according to a source at the brokerage firm.</p>
<p>-- No further information was immediately available. Analyst Gary Gordon declined to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the Jacksonville, Fla.-based residential mortgage lender closed at 15-1/4 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
